[1;33m[WARN][0m   Review: changes_requested (7 issue(s)) — The prescribed root cause fix for the service layer IS implemented — live_preview config with management_token, host, and enable fields has been added to the options object in src/services/contentstack.ts (lines 78-81), and CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_TOKEN/CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_HOST env vars are destructured (lines 36-37). However, the implementation is incomplete against the acceptance criteria. AC2 and AC3 (real-time updates without manual reload) are unmet because: (1) no reactive Provider component exists — useContent returns a static value from ContentstackContext with no onEntryChange subscription; (2) the @contentstack/live-preview-utils SDK is not installed; (3) ContentstackContext is a static createContext with no reactive Provider. AC1 is partially met (SDK config enables draft fetching capability) but practically unmet because ICreateQueryConfig/ICreateEntryConfig lack live_preview params and includeFallback() is never called, so queries never actually fetch draft content. AC4 and AC5 are moot without a working preview. No vitest unit tests were added for the live preview feature. The implementation needs: a reactive ContentstackProvider with onEntryChange subscription, the live-preview-utils dependency, includeFallback() calls in query methods, updated interfaces with live_preview params, and corresponding unit tests.

